    <div class="sh-body">
      <span class="sh-key">Before you ship</span>
      <div class="sh-num">01</div>
      <h2>Get Tony's OK before you send anything</h2>
      <p>Email or text Tony to confirm he'll be here to receive your package. <strong>Wait for his OK, then ship.</strong></p>
      <div class="sh-reach">
        <div><small>Email</small><a href="mailto:tony@cabbagecoins.com">tony@cabbagecoins.com</a></div>
        <div><small>Text</small><a href="sms:+17177239505">(717) 723-9505</a></div>
      </div>
      <p class="sh-why">Why: Tony travels to coin shows and can be away from the PO box for a week or more. A package that sits at the post office is a risk for both of us.</p>
    </div>
  </li>

