    <div class="sh-body">
      <div class="sh-num">03</div>
      <h2>Wrap each coin securely</h2>
      <ul class="cc26-checks">
        <li><strong>Sending 2 or more slabs? Rubber-band them together</strong> into one stack so they can't jostle around.</li>
        <li><strong>Bubble wrap the coin or the stack</strong> and tape the wrap closed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sh-tip"><b>Tip</b>Wrap the bubble-wrapped bundle in aluminum foil, especially for newer PCGS slabs. These slabs have a chip that a phone can read through the box, showing what the coin is and hinting at what's inside. Foil blocks it. It's optional as long as your package is insured.</p>
