    </div>
    <div class="sh-body">
      <div class="sh-num">04</div>
      <h2>Use a box inside a box</h2>
      <ul class="cc26-checks">
        <li><strong>Pack the wrapped coins in a small inner box.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Write the shipping address on the inner box too</strong> (or tape a copy of the label to it).</li>
        <li>Put the inner box inside the outer box and fill every gap with bubble wrap or packing paper.</li>
        <li><strong>Shake it gently. If anything moves or rattles, add more padding.</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sh-why">Our insurance requires a box inside a box with the address on the inner box. If the outer box is damaged, the package can still reach us.</p>
    </div>
  </li>

