      <div class="sh-num">05</div>
      <h2>Seal it well and attach the label</h2>
      <ul class="cc26-checks">
        <li><strong>Tape every seam and edge</strong> of the outer box with packing tape.</li>
        <li><strong>Attach the shipping label securely</strong> so all four edges are flat and can't peel off.</li>
        <li>Double-check the address matches your carrier (step 2).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </li>

  <!-- 6 INSURE -->
  <li class="sh-step sh-step--flip" id="s6">
    <div class="sh-art">
