    <div class="sh-body">
      <div class="sh-num">06</div>
      <h2>Insure it for the full value</h2>
      <p><strong>Insure the package for the full value of everything inside</strong>: the agreed price, or your best estimate if Tony hasn't made an offer yet.</p>
      <p>Ask for a tracking number and keep your receipt until Tony confirms the package arrived.</p>
    </div>
  </li>

