      <p>As soon as you ship, email or text Tony <strong>how you sent it (USPS or FedEx) and the tracking number</strong>, so he knows when to expect it.</p>
      <div class="sh-reach">
        <div><small>Email</small><a href="mailto:tony@cabbagecoins.com">tony@cabbagecoins.com</a></div>
        <div><small>Text</small><a href="sms:+17177239505">(717) 723-9505</a></div>
      </div>
